<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Photorealistic Midjourney Architecture Portrait — PromptVibe HQ</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;1,6..72,400&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body { background-color: #0e0e0e; color: #e0e0e0; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
      .font-serif-title { font-family: 'Newsreader', serif; }
      .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; width: 100%; }
      header { border-bottom: 1px solid #262626; background-color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 0.9); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 50; height: 80px; display: flex; align-items: center; }
      .header-content { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; width: 100%; }
      .logo { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
      .logo-dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; background-color: #22c55e; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }
      nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; }
      nav a { color: #a3a3a3; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; }
      nav a:hover { color: #fff; }

      .back-btn { color: #22c55e; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; font-family: monospace; display: inline-block; margin: 32px 0 16px 0; }
      .category-tag { font-size: 12px; font-family: monospace; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 9999px; background-color: #262626; color: #22c55e; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 16px; }
      h1 { font-size: 42px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.2; }
      .description { font-size: 18px; color: #a3a3a3; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 32px; }

      /* AdSense Placeholder Banner */
      .adsense-banner { background-color: #171717; border: 1px dashed #404040; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; color: #737373; font-size: 12px; font-family: monospace; margin-bottom: 32px; }

      /* Visual Preview Card */
      .preview-image { width: 100%; height: 420px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid #262626; margin-bottom: 32px; }

      /* Copy Area */
      .prompt-card { background-color: #171717; border: 1px solid #262626; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
      .prompt-box { background-color: #080808; border: 1px solid #262626; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: #fff; font-family: monospace; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; }
      .copy-btn { width: 100%; padding: 14px; background-color: #22c55e; color: #000; border: none; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; }
      .copy-btn:hover { background-color: #16a34a; }

      /* SEO Text Section */
      .info-section { background-color: rgba(23, 23, 23, 0.5); border: 1px solid #262626; border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
      .info-section h2 { color: #fff; font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
      .info-section p { color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 16px; }
      .info-section ul { color: #a3a3a3; margin-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; }

      footer { border-top: 1px solid #262626; margin-top: 80px; padding: 40px 0; text-align: center; color: #737373; font-size: 12px; font-family: monospace; }
      .footer-links { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
      .footer-links a { color: #a3a3a3; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    
    <header>
      <div class="container header-content">
        <a href="/" class="logo font-serif-title">
          <span class="logo-dot"></span>
          PromptVibe<span style="font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; color: #a3a3a3;">HQ</span>
        </a>
        <nav>
          <a href="/prompts">All Prompts</a>
          <a href="/about">About</a>
          <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
          <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container" style="flex-grow: 1;">
      <a href="/prompts" class="back-btn">← Back to All Prompts</a>
      
      <div>
        <span class="category-tag">Midjourney / Design</span>
        <h1 class="font-serif-title">Photorealistic Architect Portrait Prompt</h1>
        <p class="description">Generate stunning 8K cinematic studio portraits of professional architects with exact lighting and focal length settings.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Top AdSense Banner Space -->
      <div class="adsense-banner">
        [ Google AdSense Header Banner Slot ]
      </div>

      <!-- Visual Result Preview -->
      <img 
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" 
        alt="AI Generated Portrait Sample" 
        class="preview-image"
      />

      <!-- Main Copy Prompt Area -->
      <div class="prompt-card">
        <div style="font-size: 12px; font-family: monospace; color: #22c55e; margin-bottom: 12px;">COPYABLE PROMPT</div>
        <div class="prompt-box" id="promptContent">A realistic portrait photo of a 30-year-old architect, cinematic lighting, 85mm lens, f/1.8, highly detailed skin texture, professional studio background, hyperrealistic, 8k resolution --ar 16:9 --v 6.0</div>
        <button 
          class="copy-btn"
          onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(document.getElementById('promptContent').innerText); this.innerText='Copied to Clipboard! ✓'; setTimeout(()=>this.innerText='Copy Prompt 📋', 2000)"
        >
          Copy Prompt 📋
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Mid-Page AdSense Banner Space -->
      <div class="adsense-banner">
        [ Google AdSense In-Article Banner Slot ]
      </div>

      <!-- SEO Content Area (Increases Page Value for AdSense Approval) -->
      <div class="info-section">
        <h2 class="font-serif-title">How to Use This Prompt</h2>
        <p>To achieve the exact result shown in the preview image, follow these recommended settings when running Midjourney v6:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Aspect Ratio:</strong> Use <code>--ar 16:9</code> for horizontal cinematic shots or <code>--ar 4:5</code> for Instagram portraits.</li>
          <li><strong>Model Version:</strong> Designed specifically for Midjourney v6.0 for enhanced skin texture details.</li>
          <li><strong>Stylize parameter:</strong> Recommended <code>--s 250</code> for natural lighting realism.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>You can substitute 'architect' with any other profession (e.g., 'software engineer', 'fashion designer') while keeping the 85mm lens parameter to preserve background blur and bokeh effects.</p>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/prompts">All Prompts</a>
        <a href="/about">About Us</a>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
      </div>
      <p>© 2026 PromptVibe HQ. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>